# nobody's Home Directory

Here /home/nobody is the path nobody's home directory.
Create share directory, set mode and owner as follows.
You can do it (1) step by step, or (2) Using install command.

## share

```bash
# (1) Step by step method.
sudo mkdir /home/nobody/share
sudo chmod ug=rwx,o= /home/nobody/share
sudo chown nobody:nogroup /home/nobody/share
# or (2) Using install command.
sudo install -m 770 -o nobody -g nogroup /home/nobody/share
```
